# Vernal Fen: "This land enters tapped unless you control two or more basic lands." Turn 5 Bot1 controls a Swamp (one
# basic) and a Bayou (the Swamp and Forest types, but not basic, CR 205.4a): one basic is below the two, so its Vernal Fen
# enters tapped - though Bot2, its opponent, controls two basic lands by then. Bot2 with a Swamp and a Forest of its own
# plays the same land on turn 6 and it enters untapped (positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Bayou
Vernal Fen
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Forest
Vernal Fen
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Bayou.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Vernal Fen.Play
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Vernal Fen.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Vernal Fen.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Vernal Fen.Tapped = false
